--[[
	AssetMap  (ModuleScript)
	Put in: ReplicatedStorage > Items > Modules > AssetMap

	Maps every item id to its uploaded mesh, icon and texture asset ids.
	Until you upload the files, every slot is the placeholder "rbxassetid://0".

	Workflow (details in ITEMS_MANIFEST.md):
	  1. Upload items/models/*.obj, items/icons/*.png and items/textures/*.png
	  2. Paste the numeric ids into AssetMap.RealIds below (the ONLY section you edit)
	  3. Command Bar: require(game.ReplicatedStorage.Items.Modules.AssetMap:Clone()).BuildMeshTemplates()
	  4. In game code: imageLabel.Image = AssetMap.GetIcon(itemId)
	                   local model = ReplicatedStorage.Items.Models.Fish[itemId]:Clone()

	59 items have mesh + icon slots, 6 shop items have an icon slot only.

	GENERATED by tools/items/gen_luau.py from tools/items/item_data.py.
	To change numbers, edit item_data.py and re-run the generator (or edit here and keep both in sync).
]]

